      "documentation": {
        "summary": "Reads a public stream/replay page through POST /api/v1/streams/read.",
        "remarks": "On the human/authority transport, a platform-scope tenant (for example platform:tenants) is also sent as the explicit X-Hexalith-Scope header; the returned page carries the retained storage identity. With UseWorkloadTransport, the client delegates to ReadWorkloadStreamAsync: only the approved platform:tenants/tenants and platform:global-administrators/global-administrators mappings may return the reserved storage Tenant, with exact Domain and AggregateId validation.",
